'''Sammy''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[American Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

== Appearance ==
Sammy is a bald eagle that has the colors from the American flag on its feathers, blue making up its body, a white head and tail and red and white wings.

== Trivia ==
*Sammy the eagle represents freedom and Uncle Sam who represented American pride starting in the War of 1812, and still is to this day.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox hat [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/264984497/American-Eagle American Eagle].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Amerilaser]] and the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Old Glory]], making the '''Full Old Glory Set.'''

